From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since42 keep IRQ live after 0x02

since41: leftover 0x1b not locking skip (good), touch_init ok, gpio=1,
then 0x30 and identify both -62. IRQ stuck at 3.

Cause: syna_tcm_romboot_drain_attn() always disable_irq and never
releases. Forced 0x30 waited on a masked line.

since42: after 0x02 IDENTIFY, touch_init, release_irq, no drain, no 0x30,
no blocking identify.

